<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lyndelou Lapad - Portfolio</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
body{background:#0f0f0f;color:#fff;line-height:1.6}
header{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f0f0f 0%,#1a1a1a 100%)}
.profile-img{width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #fff;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:20px;background:#333}
h1{font-size:2.5rem;margin:10px 0}
h1 span{color:#00ff88}
p.tagline{color:#aaa;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:25px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background:#00ff88;color:#000;text-decoration:none;border-radius:30px;font-weight:bold;margin:5px}
section{padding:60px 20px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
h2{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:4px solid #00ff88;padding-left:15px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:#1a1a1a;padding:25px;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #2a2a2a}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px;background:#1a1a1a;color:#777;margin-top:40px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div>
<img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Lyndelou+Lapad&background=00ff88&color=000&size=200" alt="Profile" class="profile-img" id="profilePic">
<h1>Hi, I'm <span>Lyndelou Lapad</span></h1>
<p class="tagline">Designer | Developer | Creative Mind</p>
<a href="#work" class="btn">View My Work</a>
<a href="mailto:lyndeloulapad@gmail.com" class="btn" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1px solid #fff">Contact Me</a>
</div>
</header>

<section id="about">
<h2>About Me</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>I'm a passionate designer from Cagayan de Oro, focused on creating clean, modern, and user-friendly digital experiences. I love turning ideas into beautiful designs that work.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="work">
<h2>My Work</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>🎨 UI/UX Design</h3><p>Modern and clean interface designs for web and mobile.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>💻 Web Development</h3><p>Responsive websites using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>✨ Branding</h3><p>Creative brand identity and visual design solutions.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>📧 Email: lyndeloulapad@gmail.com</p>
<p>📍 Location: Quezon, Bukidnon 
